* Adding new API endpoints

9. Next_Steps.md
Purpose:
* Lists immediate, short-term, medium-term, and long-term tasks
* Defines Phase 1 implementation steps
* Documents backend debugging tasks

Use When:
* Starting a new coding session
* Planning next day’s work
* Tracking progress across phases

10. Glossary.md
Purpose:
* Defines all project terminology
* Ensures consistent vocabulary across docs and code

Use When:
